{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1081.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"bbe03852d9fc22c4ae3a657815c33b0aecaf2cc04c15b30ca259c3d01b7fbf33","ja":"……ハナシ、チガウヨ。\nこの映画って……。","zh":"……和说好的，不一样。\n这部电影……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1081.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"f02c5976d4702324a5014f73cd2c9eeac63c63c1e3472086853f39fb6a2e17c3","ja":"ヤンデレ系じゃん！？","zh":"这不是病娇系的吗！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1081.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"f5dfca9ab501315e0e6eaad549c700946d89fd56dbc48d845c7b6b88d84f7649","ja":"お、女の子が問い詰める場面……\nと、とても怖かったです～！","zh":"女、女孩子逼问的场面……\n真、真是太吓人了～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1081.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a74b19e5401c255a52df799c1e2e4402dc9ffee31d9543c2be881a2c77979502","ja":"もうホラー映画だよねっ！　最初は普通の女の子\nだったのに……急に怖くなるのは反則っしょ～！","zh":"这根本就是恐怖片吧！明明一开始只是个普通的\n女孩子……突然变得这么吓人太犯规了吧～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1081.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"ddfdc294f9ca3210ccf8a6a4ba903c6dd6a5f223876117aeca3a5a8caad4c102","ja":"わかる……女の子が追いかけてくるとこ、\n夢に出そう……。","zh":"我懂……女孩子追上来的那一幕，\n感觉会出现在梦里……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1081.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"37419abbe0f19ebe3204b18b28d6826d2ff62859cb75549984b0db9527d602ad","ja":"……って、志保はなんだか余裕そうだな？\n怖くなかったのか？","zh":"……话说，志保看起来倒挺从容的啊？\n不害怕吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1081.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"804f685cce0fa9842c1fc0c47537868d16092eda9486291fca45480dfd31390a","ja":"……ええ、まあ。","zh":"……嗯，算是吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1081.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"23ce0839927a577d4f5997c9d7d581ba311ba93e70ea71446ecb27405c5fa71a","ja":"すげーな！　オレなんて、病室で女の子が\nベッドの下から出てきたときは泣きそうになったよ～！","zh":"好厉害啊！我啊，在病房里看到女孩子\n从床底下钻出来的时候，都快被吓哭了～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1081.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"f424ea39d662bdedd049427db6428cd249ba72d2818b8d36fe53c0e0158e10c0","ja":"うっ……！　あ、あのシーンのことは、\nもう忘れましょう！","zh":"唔……！那、那个场景的事，\n就快点忘掉吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1081.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"4907979e68202e8f48d2ffef28e14530c32bca3f055a0d8d71e12d0fd85c2834","ja":"えっ？　志保……？","zh":"诶？　志保……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1081.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"a0df51b3cd80588ebad5a54af8c449fbe67097a984f9130f889982747d012fae","ja":"い、いえ……。\nそ、それより早く控室に戻りましょう。","zh":"没、没什么……\n比、比起这个，快点回休息室吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1081.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"ac74e75ac94f23de053f888f53384579fb80a524a4e4cff7b25add99dcfd7ccd","ja":"取材を受けないといけませんから。\n映画の感想をまとめておかないと！","zh":"还得接受采访呢。\n得先把电影的感想整理好才行！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1081.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"a8a5d801dfe7606bce36e3dc0ccde3a46b3d3e2e62d4856cd8f28887a3c75faf","ja":"（志保も怖かったんだな……\nホント、『衝撃の初恋』だったぜ……！）","zh":"（志保其实也很害怕吧……\n真不愧是“极具冲击性的初恋”啊……！）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
